      "summary": "micronaut-security-jwt is a self-contained token generation/validation library built on com.nimbusds:nimbus-jose-jwt (declared as a transitive compile dependency in its POM, resolved automatically by Gradle). Its core APIs (secret/RSA/EC signature configurations, JwtTokenGenerator/JwtTokenValidator) operate entirely in-memory with no network calls, database, or external service — the same pattern confirmed by this repo's existing org.springframework.security:spring-security-oauth2-jose and spring-security-oauth2-resource-server tests, which needed only the library itself plus assertj-core and no Docker/env setup despite handling JWT signing, JWK-based validation, and issuer checks.",
